Surprise-oh]、[Dissatisfaction-hnn]（不满的哼声）\n\n1.声音设计案例：\n控制指令：\n威严深沉的恶魔男声，语速缓慢，自带回音感和极强的压迫力，仿佛高高在上的神明。\n台词文本：\n[laughing]就凭你这点微末道行，也敢和我斗？可笑！\n\n2.声音设计案例：\n控制指令：\n年轻女性，温柔自然，点一点疲惫。\n台词文本：\n[sigh]第九版方案又被打回来了。[sigh]连熬了三个通宵，嗓子都说不出话了，好想辞职啊。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [438.8857421875, 978.6921997070312], "pos": [236.30674743652344, 457.9881591796875], "id": 4, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [3], "label": "文本", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "显示帮助", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["可爱的孩子声，大笑且轻蔑"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [491.8389892578125, 145.4290008544922], "pos": [755.0181884765625, 910.2793579101562], "id": 6, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 4}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [-980.1516852005135, -313.31340859391537], "scale": 1.4122927695244518}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 34, "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 2, "title": "台词文本", "bounding": [724.6195678710938, 1084.37939453125, 558.6369018554688, 369.99700927734375]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 34, "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 3, "title": "上传想要被克隆的声音", "bounding": [722.2412719726562, 576.3624267578125, 561.16552734375, 243.22775268554688]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 34, "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 4, "title": "控制指令", "bounding": [722.8679809570312, 826.1834106445312, 561.43017578125, 243.28500366210938]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 34, "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 6, "title": "模型", "bounding": [1299.763671875, 420.072509765625, 544.2965087890625, 869.1537475585938]}], "links": [